{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":565,"skin":"魔法","skin_jp":"マジカル","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":142,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":565,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/Student_Portrait_CH0326_Collection.png","skin":"魔法","skin_cn":""}],"family_name":"宇泽","given_name":"玲纱","family_name_jp":"宇沢","given_name_jp":"レイサ","family_name_kr":"우자와","given_name_kr":"레이사","family_name_en":"Uzawa","given_name_en":"Reisa","family_name_zh_tw":"宇澤","given_name_zh_tw":"澪紗","family_name_cn":"宇泽","given_name_cn":"玲纱","nick_name":"","momo_talk_signature":"The ♡ of the Magical Girl","main_relation":11,"relation":null,"age":15,"grade":"一年生","height":153,"birthday":"05-31","hobby":"决斗申请、自报家门","designer":"kokosando","illustrator":"kokosando","character_voice":"根本京里","character_voice_cn":"虚元","release_date":"2025-10-22","release_date_cn":null,"release_date_global":null,"school":2,"weapon_type":"SG","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":false,"is_install_global":false,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Medium","special_appearance":false,"spine":[1180,1185],"model":[477,480],"voice":[{"description":"ch0326_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"今，今天……人也好多啊……。","text_original":"きょ、今日も……人が多い……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"尽，尽量，像平常一样……。","text_original":"な、なるべく、普段どおりに……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"（啊！刚刚聊的……是我知道的话题！）","text_original":"（あっ！今の……知ってる話だ！）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"大家，好像都很开心呢！","text_original":"みなさん、楽しそうですね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"（啊……座位，被别人坐了……）","text_original":"（ああっ……席、取られてる……）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"用爱！和勇气！以及友谊的力量！","text_original":"愛と！勇気と！友情パワーで！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"在！我是热恋粉！也叫宇泽玲纱！","text_original":"はい！テルミットピンクです！宇沢レイサでもあります！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventlobby_2_1","category":"event","text":"哼哼，练习了这么久的变身姿势……就在这里展示出来吧！首先是……咿啊！？","text_original":"ふふっ、ずっと練習してきた変身のポーズを……ここでお見せしましょう！まずは………ひゃあっ！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventlobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventlobby_2_2","category":"event","text":"刚，刚才……好像和认识的人对上目光了……。","text_original":"い、いま……知り合いと目があった気が……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventlobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventlobby_3_1","category":"event","text":"你说这个吗？这是热恋粉的魔法杖！","text_original":"これですか？テルミットピンクのステッキです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventlobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventlobby_3_2","category":"event","text":"官方的魔法杖稍微有点贵……所以就拿自己的东西装饰了一个！","text_original":"公式のステッキはちょっと高くて……なので、自前のものをデコってみました！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventlobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventlobby_4_1","category":"event","text":"热恋粉！变身！","text_original":"テルミットピンク！変身！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventlobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventlobby_4_2","category":"event","text":"来吧！去守护和平吧！","text_original":"さあ！平和を守りに行きましょう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventlobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"老师！在这边！这边！哼哼，眼睛跟不上我的速度了吧？","text_original":"先生！こっちです！こっち！ふふっ、私の速さに目が追いつかなかったんですね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"自警团的超级魔法战士！热恋～……粉！","text_original":"自警団のスーパーマジカルウォーリアー！テルミット～……ピンク！です！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"唔哇！好多客人啊！","text_original":"うわあ！お客さんがいっぱいですね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventlogin_season_2_1","category":"event","text":"哼哼哼……好像谁都没有注意到呢……。","text_original":"ふっふっふ……誰も気づいていないようですね……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventlogin_season_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventlogin_season_2_2","category":"event","text":"这样普通的我，其实既是自警团的超级精英，也是魔法少女……！","text_original":"平凡な私が、実は自警団のスーパーエースであり、魔法少女であることをっ……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventlogin_season_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"虽然变身解除了……但是魔法是不会消失的！诶嘿嘿！","text_original":"変身は解けちゃいましたけど……魔法は終わりません！えへへっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventlogin_season_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventshop_1","category":"event","text":"啊，这身衣服不卖哦！因为仅此一件！","text_original":"あ、この服は売り物じゃないですよ！一着しかないので！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventshop_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventshop_2","category":"event","text":"跟特产店一样，真有意思呢！","text_original":"お土産屋さんみたいで、楽しいですね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventshop_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventshop_buy_1","category":"event","text":"交易……也就是说，这是交换契约！","text_original":"取引……すなわち、契約を交わすということ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventshop_buy_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventshop_buy_2","category":"event","text":"这就是大人的财力……！像个英雄一样！","text_original":"これが大人の財力……！ヒーローみたいです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventshop_buy_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventshop_buy_3","category":"event","text":"那个东西，看上去感觉有点像魔法道具呢！","text_original":"それ、なんだかマジカルアイテムみたいです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventshop_buy_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventshop_buy_4","category":"event","text":"这里是！魔法商城！","text_original":"マジカル・ショッピング！ですね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventshop_buy_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventshop_end","category":"event","text":"不会打半折的哦！？毕竟这里不是超市！","text_original":"半額シールはないですよ！？ここはスーパーじゃありませんから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventshop_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventshop_login_1","category":"event","text":"咻咻～铛铛！！闪！","text_original":"シュルル～シャキーンシャキーン！！キラッ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventshop_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_eventshop_login_2","category":"event","text":"欢迎来到魔法市场！","text_original":"ようこそ！マジカル市場へ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_eventshop_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"从上膛坡道划入弹膛……！6条顺时针魔法啊……！","text_original":"フィードランプよりチャンバーへ……6条右回りの魔法……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"赐予我无坚不摧之力！","text_original":"揺るぎなき力をっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"这就是我！","text_original":"これが、私です！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"上膛就绪！热恋粉！","text_original":"ボルトフォワード！テルミットピンク！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"正义的伙伴，降临！","text_original":"正義の味方、降臨！です！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"亮——！磅！磅磅磅！","text_original":"キラーン！バーン！ババババン！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"老师对我一直都很温柔呢……。就这样在一起……我感觉自己就会变得最强！","text_original":"先生は、いつも優しくしてくださるんですね……。こうして一緒にいると……私、最強になれる気がしますっ……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"热恋粉！出击！","text_original":"テルミットピンク！出ます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"正义的魔法自警团，出击！","text_original":"正義のマジカル自警団、いきます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"宇泽玲纱！又称～热恋粉！","text_original":"宇沢レイサ！またの名を～テルミットピンク！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"随叫随到！再次前来！魔法少女，魔法宇泽玲纱，登场！","text_original":"呼ばれて飛び出て！再び参りました！魔法少女、マジカル宇沢レイサ、登場です！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"这个……我真的可以收下吗？非常感谢！","text_original":"これ……私が受け取っても大丈夫なのでしょうか？ありがとうございます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"有了从老师那里得到的力量，我绝对会成长的！","text_original":"先生にいただいたこの力で、絶対成長してみせます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"宇泽玲纱的目标，是进入更高的境界！","text_original":"宇沢レイサは、さらなる高みを目指していきますよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"为了老师的话！二重变身……不，就连十七重变身我也会去做的！！","text_original":"先生のためなら私！二段変身……いえ、十七段変身だってしますので！！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"回应老师的召唤……！","text_original":"先生の呼び出しに応え……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"热恋粉，在此登场！","text_original":"テルミットピンク、ここに参上！です！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"自警团也做一套制服怎么样！","text_original":"自警団も、制服を作るのはどうでしょう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"机会难得，还是穿得帅一点比较好！","text_original":"せっかくならこういう、カッコイイのがいいです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"闪电突进！热恋粉……！","text_original":"ボルトフォワード！テルミットピンク……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊！老师你好！我刚刚在练习台词……。","text_original":"あ！こんにちは先生！ちょっとセリフの練習をしていまして……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_lobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师你知道「魔法火力」第3季第4话的那句名台词吗？","text_original":"先生は「まほリバ」3期4話の名台詞をご存知ですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_lobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_lobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"“友情和火力一样越灼热越好”！真是句很棒的话呢！","text_original":"「友情と火力は熱ければ熱いほど良い」、です！良い言葉ですよね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_lobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"肚子稍微有点饿了……对了！","text_original":"ちょっと小腹が空きましたね……そうだ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"我打算去买面包，老师也要吃吗？","text_original":"パンを買ってこようと思うんですが、先生も食べますか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_login_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"哼哼哼……来得真迟呢，老师。不不，请别难过啊！","text_original":"ふふふ……遅かったですね、先生。いえいえ、気を落とさないでください！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_login_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_login_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"所谓正义的伙伴，就是要比任何人都更快动身的存在！","text_original":"正義の味方は、誰よりも早く駆けつけるものですから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_login_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_login_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"请忘记自警团的宇泽玲纱吧……。","text_original":"自警団の宇沢レイサのことは、忘れてください……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_login_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_login_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"今天的我……是至尊魔法自警团的宇泽玲纱！","text_original":"今日の私は……シュプリームマジカル自警団、宇沢レイサですからっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_login_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"成—功！","text_original":"セーフッ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"哼哼……守护住风筝的安全了！","text_original":"ふふ……凧の平和は守られました！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_1_3","category":"lobby","text":"就在马上要落水之前！像这样直接抓住了！","text_original":"水に落ちる寸前に！こうやって捕まえられたのですから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_1_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"只要是为了大家，自警团是不会迷茫的！","text_original":"みんなのためでしたら、自警団は迷いません！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"不管是刀山还是火海！哪里都会挺身跃入！","text_original":"火の中だろうと、水の中だろうと！どこだって飛び込んでみせますから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"嘿嘿……！","text_original":"にへへ……っ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"所谓英雄的衣服——","text_original":"ヒーローの衣装というのは――","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"在执行英雄的任务时才会无比闪耀！","text_original":"ヒーローとしての仕事をするときにこそ輝くものっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_3_3","category":"lobby","text":"还有，这身衣服可以机洗所以没问题！","text_original":"あと、これは洗濯機オッケーなので大丈夫です！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_3_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"而且……老师也，教过我。","text_original":"それに……先生に、教わりましたから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"正因为是不会迷茫的人——才能够去守护大家！诶嘿嘿！","text_original":"迷わない者こそ――みんなを守ることができる、と！えへへっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"嘿嘿，啊，阿……。","text_original":"へへ、え、へえっ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"阿嚏！！","text_original":"へくしょん！！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_memoriallobby_5_3","category":"lobby","text":"唔……。","text_original":"ううぅ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_memoriallobby_5_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_omikuji_1","category":"event","text":"会抽出什么来呢！真有意思！","text_original":"何が出るんでしょう！楽しみです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_omikuji_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_omikuji_2","category":"event","text":"这个，好厉害啊！要是能把它摆在我的家里就好了……！","text_original":"ここ、すごく素敵ですね！ここが私の家だったらいいのに……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_omikuji_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_omikuji_end","category":"event","text":"来，把剩下的全～都用掉吧！","text_original":"さあ、残った分ぜ～んぶ使って回しましょう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_omikuji_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_omikuji_login_1_1","category":"event","text":"哇啊！这是！能抽卡的那个东西吧！真怀念呢！","text_original":"わあっ！これは！カードが引けるやつですね！すごく懐かしいです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_omikuji_login_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_omikuji_login_1_2","category":"event","text":"像这样！嘎吱嘎吱！地转它就行了哦！","text_original":"こう！ガコガコッ！と回せばいいんですよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_omikuji_login_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_omikuji_login_2_1","category":"event","text":"原来里面还有这样的啊！","text_original":"こういうの、まだ残っていたんですね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_omikuji_login_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_omikuji_login_2_2","category":"event","text":"来吧老师！快点转吧！","text_original":"さあ先生！早く回しましょう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_omikuji_login_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_omikujipickup_1","category":"event","text":"啊啊！这个是！UR！这可是我一次都没抽到过的，超级！稀有的卡哦！","text_original":"ああっ！それは！ウルトラレア！？私も一度しか引いたことがない、超！レアカードですよ！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_omikujipickup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_omikujipickup_2","category":"event","text":"哦哦！SR！很少见呢！","text_original":"おおっ！スーパーレア！あまり見かけないんですよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_omikujipickup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_omikujipickup_3","category":"event","text":"黄金卡！！不错呢！闪亮亮的！","text_original":"ゴールド！！いいですね！キラキラしています！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_omikujipickup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_omikujipickup_4","category":"event","text":"啊啊，啊……。","text_original":"ああっ、ああ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_omikujipickup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_omikujipickup_5","category":"event","text":"这是错卡呢！我也是第一次见到实物！","text_original":"それはハズレカードですね！私も実物は初めて見ます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_omikujipickup_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"羁绊的力量无比强大！嗯，简直就是！最强的力量呢！","text_original":"絆の力は強いんです！ええ、それはもう！最強なんですよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"虽说我很向往英雄的强大……那个……老师的温柔，我也很向往。","text_original":"ヒーローの強さにも憧れていますが……その……先生の優しさにも、とても憧れています。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"老师经常夸我吧？我真的……很高兴。","text_original":"先生はよく私のことを褒めてくださるでしょう？それがすごく……嬉しいんです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"世界和平和老师……我都会守护好的！","text_original":"世界の平和と先生、両方を……守ってみせます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"生日？谁的？……啊！是我的！","text_original":"誕生日？誰のですか？……ああっ！私でした！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_season_birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"感谢您的祝福！诶嘿嘿……。","text_original":"祝ってくださりありがとうございます！えへへ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_season_birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您生日快乐！","text_original":"先生、お誕生日おめでとうございます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_season_birthday_player_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"如果我会用魔法的话，就能给老师施放祝福魔法了呢！诶嘿嘿。","text_original":"私に魔法が使えたら、先生に祝福魔法をかけてあげられたんですけど！えへへ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_season_birthday_player_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"不给糖就捣乱！万圣节快乐！","text_original":"トリックオアマジック！ハッピーハロウィーン、です！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_season_halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"魔女的变装？不不不！这身是魔法少女！","text_original":"魔女の仮装？いえいえ！これは魔法少女です！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_season_halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_season_halloween_3","category":"lobby","text":"魔女和魔法少女完全不是一回事哦？","text_original":"魔女と魔法少女は全然違うんですよ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_season_halloween_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您新年快乐！希望今年也是充满正义的一年！","text_original":"先生、明けましておめでとうございます！今年も、正義が満ちあふれる一年となりますように！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_season_xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞～魔法～！","text_original":"マジカル～クリスマ～ス！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%87%E6%B3%BD%20%E7%8E%B2%E7%BA%B1/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%91%E5%A5%B3/jp/ch0326_season_xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0326_season_xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"哇！应该是“圣诞快乐”才对的！","text_original":"わっ！マジカルじゃなくて